<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus April CPI increases 0.90 pct mnth/mnth.</title>
<headline>Cyprus April CPI increases 0.90 pct mnth/mnth.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus's consumer price index increased by 0.90 percent month-on-month in April to 120.55 units from 119.47 units in March, the island's statistics and research department announced.</p>
<p>    Consumer price index     April 97   March 97  April 96</p>
<p>    Month/month change (pct)  0.90	 2.78	0.42</p>
<p>    Year/year change (pct)    4.17	 3.67	2.95</p>
<p>    Index (92=100)		120.55     119.47    115.72</p>
<p>The department said increases were registered in the prices of certain fresh vegetables, potatoes, bread, clothing and footwear. Decreases were recorded for fresh fruit and electricity.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
